OL,3,A'Cult' priest guilty of rape and
OL,4,Aassault of women
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former priest who established a
OL,7,F"cult" within the Church of England has
OL,8,Fbeen found guilty of raping a woman in
OL,9,Fhis congregation.
OL,11,FChris Brain was also convicted of four
OL,12,Fcounts of indecent assault against
OL,13,Fthree other women who were part of the
OL,14,FNine O'Clock Service in Sheffield in
OL,15,Fthe 1980s and 1990s.
OL,17,FThe 69-year-old was found guilty of the
OL,18,Foffences after a retrial at Inner
OL,19,FLondon Crown Court, having already been
OL,20,Ffound guilty of 17 indecent assaults
OL,21,Fagainst nine women at a trial last
OL,22,Fyear.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
